{{Term/Store|Old Shirt|Old Shirts|Series, BotW|plural}} are [[Item]]s in {{BotW}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Old Shirt is a heavily-worn piece of [[Armor]] that was made long before [[Link]]'s awakening from the [[Slumber of Restoration]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Due to its short sleeves and lower hem, it does not appear to have been made for Link at his age. The Old Shirt provides no additional benefits from wearing it other than marginally boosting Link's defense. It can be obtained either from a stone [[Treasure Chest]] inside the [[Shrine of Resurrection]] or from [[Granté]] in [[Tarrey Town]] after the "[[From the Ground Up]]" [[Side Quest]] is completed.

